<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH - NIB UPS KLM TO MARKET PERFORMER.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH - NIB UPS KLM TO MARKET PERFORMER.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary (06/08)</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>KLM		 airline	 80.50   NIB Securies</p>
<p>COMMENT: Market Performer (from Underperformer)</p>
<p>First qtr figures were excellent, average yield much better than expected. In quarters ahead, KLM will benefit even more from solid volume developments.</p>
<p>We stuck to Underperformer rating too long and therefore missed latest rally. We expect KLM to be in structurally improved position which has its effect on structural growth as well.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):    EPS     P/E    Dividend</p>
<p>    1996/97 (actual)    6.03    13.4   1.00</p>
<p>    1997/98		 6.63    12.1   2.00</p>
<p>    1998/99		 7.29    11.0   2.00</p>
